  m_text: "<size=20>- Copy symbols appear during Free Games.\n\n- Whenever a Copy
    symbol appears, it creates a special frame in\n   that position, or upgrades the
    pre-existing special frame by\n   one level. \n\n- In addition, it copies the
    same frame to the identical spot on\n   the other reel set.\n\n- Copy feature
    will only happen if doing so upgrades the value\n   of the identical spot on the
    other reel set. "
